If people are skipping past parts of the game, they probably don't
like those parts of the game: they're too dangerous or too boring or
whatever. I've read posts here on RGRN from people who *hate* Sokoban.
Should we require them to do Sokoban by putting a fourth Invocation
Artifact at the top? Forcing people to do things they dislike just to
ensure that everyone goes through the same experiences is probably
contra-productive in the context of a game. Nethack is a game. It's
not a sport or a competition or a standardized test. "Shortcuts" are
fine if you want to use them.

